 t we will also have a coloring sheet or a simple craft for the younger chi
 ldren.\n\nJune 18: Create your own Journal! We will teach you how to make 
 a journal with ordinary paper and decorate it with collages\, stickers\, d
 rawings\, buttons\, etc.\n\nJune 25: Create a bookmark - with dried leaves
 \, flowers\, words of wisdom or funny jokes\, beads and tassels.
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/16955253
