DESCRIPTION:Join local activists to take action for change! Fight the Trum
 p regime by joining our Woodland Activist Circle. We meet at the spacious 
 and well-appointed community room at the County Library in Yolo\, Californ
 ia. The hamlet of Yolo is just a short six-mile drive up Interstate 5. Bri
 ng your picnic dinner and a lawn chair if you'd like to stay for a social 
 hour at 7:00. Orientation for newcomers will be included. This event is no
 t sponsored by Yolo County Library and the presence of Indivisible Yo
LOCATION:Yolo Branch Library Community Room\, 37750 Sacramento St. Yolo CA
 \, Woodland\, CA\, 95695
